{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794570524227,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4a243affexa25EPiSDt2Sxc","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4bd1559002LRF8vZIcPYcVQM","sessionID":"ses_e2b4a243affexa25EPiSDt2Sxc","messageID":"msg_1d4bcda5c001QGXlJsocOrN5qg","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-98334d65817016a5","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin && head -c 2500 deltas/iter-001.jsonl 2>/dev/null; echo; echo \"=== files ===\"; ls deltas iterations; echo \"=== iteration1 head ===\"; head -40 iterations/iteration-001.md"},"output":"{\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"dimensions\":[\"correctness\"],\"durationMs\":420000,\"filesReviewed\":[\".opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js:1440\",\".opencode/plugins/README.md:1\",\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/index.mjs:99\",\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/claude.mjs:217\",\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/pi.mjs:282\",\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/devin.mjs:395\",\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/dsh.mjs:195\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:226\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:50\",\".skilled/hooks/shared/tests/session-readers/injected-text.test.mjs:174\"],\"findingDetails\":[{\"case\":\"A caller passes a misspelled runtime and an empty session id; the envelope says the locator is unavailable and the runtime typo is never surfaced.\",\"file\":\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/index.mjs:99\",\"findingClass\":\"instance-only\",\"id\":\"R1-P2-001\",\"scopeProof\":\"index.mjs:97-105 is the only dispatch entry; both readSession and loadSession funnel through it, and neither pre-validates runtime.\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"Unknown runtime is reported as a missing locator, not a gated capability\"},{\"case\":\"A store file reachable through a link is accepted by containment and then re-opened by its link name, so the reported storePath can differ from the file actually read.\",\"file\":\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/claude.mjs:217\",\"findingClass\":\"cross-consumer\",\"id\":\"R1-P2-002\",\"scopeProof\":\"rg -n 'storePath = containment.path' returns exactly claude.mjs, devin.mjs and dsh.mjs; pi.mjs:246-256 already reads the guard's resolved path.\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"Containment is proven on the resolved path while the bytes are opened from the caller's path\"},{\"case\":\"A user/message event whose data has role and content but no source produces zero records and one injected entry.\",\"file\":\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/dsh.mjs:195\",\"findingClass\":\"instance-only\",\"id\":\"R1-P2-003\",\"scopeProof\":\"dsh.mjs:195-207 is the only user-record branch and dsh.mjs:244-256 the only injected branch; injected-text.test.mjs:174-206 never exercises an absent source.\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"A DSH operator message with no source object is silently reclassified as injected\"},{\"case\":\"A Devin install whose sessions.db is truncated or locked returns store_unreadable although transcripts/<sessionId>.json on the same machine is intact.\",\"file\":\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/devin.mjs:395\",\"findingClass\n=== files ===\ndeltas:\niter-001.jsonl\niter-002.jsonl\niter-003.jsonl\niter-004.jsonl\niter-005.jsonl\n\niterations:\niteration-001.md\niteration-002.md\niteration-003.md\niteration-004.md\niteration-005.md\n=== iteration1 head ===\n# Review Iteration 001\n\n## Dispatcher\n\n- Mode: review (fan-out lineage `render-hooks-plugin`)\n- Session: `fanout-render-hooks-plugin-1794550137809-1ecgc7`, generation 1, lineage mode `new`\n- Review target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`\n- Area: `render-hooks-plugin` — the `render-hooks-plugin` rows of `review/review-scope.txt`, plus shared docs that describe them\n- Operator review focus addressed this iteration: \"behaviour on claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin and dsh\", read through the correctness lens — the six named runtimes resolve to the shared session-reader dispatcher plus the OpenCode hook/plugin entry point, which is what this pass executed line by line.\n- Budget profile: `verify` (12 analysis actions)\n\n## Files Reviewed\n\n- `.opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js:1-80` — constants, imports, cache and concurrency bounds\n- `.opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js:1086-1250` — per-instance state, run-slot acquisition, CLI invocation\n- `.opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js:1440-1660` — `appendAdvisorBrief`, prompt recovery, fallback delivery\n- `.opencode/plugins/README.md:1-257` — documented plugin surface and env contract\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/index.mjs:1-147` — dispatcher, capability table, failure envelope\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/claude.mjs:37-249` — store root, identity guard, loader\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/pi.mjs:44-291` — project key, live branch, disk fallback\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/devin.mjs:50-448` — SQLite projection, chain walk, transcript fallback\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/dsh.mjs:52-333` — Zstandard frame cutting, project key, event mapping\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:30-60`, `:188-262`, `:500-610` — command label, policy word, brief render\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:44-100` — policy and mutating vocabulary (read as consumer context)\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/tests/session-readers/injected-text.test.mjs:1-229` — injected-text contract across runtimes\n\n## Findings - New\n\n### P0 Findings\n\nNone.\n\n### P1 Findings\n\nNone.\n\n### P2 Findings\n\n1. **Unknown runtime is reported as a missing locator, not a gated capability** -- `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/index.mjs:99` -- `load()` validates the session id before it resolves the runtime, so `readSession({ runtime: 'cdoex', sessionId: '' })` returns `locator_unavailable`. A caller that typo'd the runtime name is told its locator is missing, and the `capability_gated` branch at `index.mjs:102` is unreachable for that shape.\nFinding class: instance-only\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"dimensions\":[\"correctness\"],\"durationMs\":420000,\"filesReviewed\":[\".opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js:1440\",\".opencode/plugins/README.md:1\",\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/index.mjs:99\",\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/claude.mjs:217\",\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/pi.mjs:282\",\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/devin.mjs:395\",\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/dsh.mjs:195\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:226\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:50\",\".skilled/hooks/shared/tests/session-readers/injected-text.test.mjs:174\"],\"findingDetails\":[{\"case\":\"A caller passes a misspelled runtime and an empty session id; the envelope says the locator is unavailable and the runtime typo is never surfaced.\",\"file\":\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/index.mjs:99\",\"findingClass\":\"instance-only\",\"id\":\"R1-P2-001\",\"scopeProof\":\"index.mjs:97-105 is the only dispatch entry; both readSession and loadSession funnel through it, and neither pre-validates runtime.\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"Unknown runtime is reported as a missing locator, not a gated capability\"},{\"case\":\"A store file reachable through a link is accepted by containment and then re-opened by its link name, so the reported storePath can differ from the file actually read.\",\"file\":\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/claude.mjs:217\",\"findingClass\":\"cross-consumer\",\"id\":\"R1-P2-002\",\"scopeProof\":\"rg -n 'storePath = containment.path' returns exactly claude.mjs, devin.mjs and dsh.mjs; pi.mjs:246-256 already reads the guard's resolved path.\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"Containment is proven on the resolved path while the bytes are opened from the caller's path\"},{\"case\":\"A user/message event whose data has role and content but no source produces zero records and one injected entry.\",\"file\":\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/dsh.mjs:195\",\"findingClass\":\"instance-only\",\"id\":\"R1-P2-003\",\"scopeProof\":\"dsh.mjs:195-207 is the only user-record branch and dsh.mjs:244-256 the only injected branch; injected-text.test.mjs:174-206 never exercises an absent source.\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"A DSH operator message with no source object is silently reclassified as injected\"},{\"case\":\"A Devin install whose sessions.db is truncated or locked returns store_unreadable although transcripts/<sessionId>.json on the same machine is intact.\",\"file\":\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/devin.mjs:395\",\"findingClass\n=== files ===\ndeltas:\niter-001.jsonl\niter-002.jsonl\niter-003.jsonl\niter-004.jsonl\niter-005.jsonl\n\niterations:\niteration-001.md\niteration-002.md\niteration-003.md\niteration-004.md\niteration-005.md\n=== iteration1 head ===\n# Review Iteration 001\n\n## Dispatcher\n\n- Mode: review (fan-out lineage `render-hooks-plugin`)\n- Session: `fanout-render-hooks-plugin-1794550137809-1ecgc7`, generation 1, lineage mode `new`\n- Review target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`\n- Area: `render-hooks-plugin` — the `render-hooks-plugin` rows of `review/review-scope.txt`, plus shared docs that describe them\n- Operator review focus addressed this iteration: \"behaviour on claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin and dsh\", read through the correctness lens — the six named runtimes resolve to the shared session-reader dispatcher plus the OpenCode hook/plugin entry point, which is what this pass executed line by line.\n- Budget profile: `verify` (12 analysis actions)\n\n## Files Reviewed\n\n- `.opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js:1-80` — constants, imports, cache and concurrency bounds\n- `.opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js:1086-1250` — per-instance state, run-slot acquisition, CLI invocation\n- `.opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js:1440-1660` — `appendAdvisorBrief`, prompt recovery, fallback delivery\n- `.opencode/plugins/README.md:1-257` — documented plugin surface and env contract\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/index.mjs:1-147` — dispatcher, capability table, failure envelope\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/claude.mjs:37-249` — store root, identity guard, loader\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/pi.mjs:44-291` — project key, live branch, disk fallback\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/devin.mjs:50-448` — SQLite projection, chain walk, transcript fallback\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/dsh.mjs:52-333` — Zstandard frame cutting, project key, event mapping\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:30-60`, `:188-262`, `:500-610` — command label, policy word, brief render\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:44-100` — policy and mutating vocabulary (read as consumer context)\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/tests/session-readers/injected-text.test.mjs:1-229` — injected-text contract across runtimes\n\n## Findings - New\n\n### P0 Findings\n\nNone.\n\n### P1 Findings\n\nNone.\n\n### P2 Findings\n\n1. **Unknown runtime is reported as a missing locator, not a gated capability** -- `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/index.mjs:99` -- `load()` validates the session id before it resolves the runtime, so `readSession({ runtime: 'cdoex', sessionId: '' })` returns `locator_unavailable`. A caller that typo'd the runtime name is told its locator is missing, and the `capability_gated` branch at `index.mjs:102` is unreachable for that shape.\nFinding class: instance-only\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin && head -c 2500 deltas/iter-001.jsonl 2>/dev/null; echo; echo \\\"=== files ===\\\"; ls deltas iterations; echo \\\"=== iteration1 head ===\\\"; head -40 iterations/iteration-001.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794570523993,"end":1794570524227}}}}
