{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794570641110,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4a243affexa25EPiSDt2Sxc","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4bed3d8001hGuHdCDhU1Ba8T","sessionID":"ses_e2b4a243affexa25EPiSDt2Sxc","messageID":"msg_1d4bec45c001h4clWAsdAJDF2X","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b247c68e68c11ea3","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n- Reading the committed diff of each pass-one fix against its owning test, rather than the old report text, showed all three `render.ts` fixes intact in one pass (iteration 1). The deleted 35-entry `DOCTOR_COMMAND_STRINGS` map could have silently dropped a doctor bridge; a key-set comparison against `COMMAND_ROWS` proved it did not.\n- Comparing duplicate command strings in `COMMAND_ROWS` before trusting the new class lookup avoided a false finding (iteration 1): the only two duplicates carry the same class.\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n- Nothing failed yet. The remaining pass-one fixes (session readers, `subprocess.ts`, docs) are scheduled for iterations 2-4.","oldString":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-2/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-2/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-2/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-2/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-2/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-2/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -81,15 +81,16 @@\n <!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n \n ## 8. WHAT WORKED\n \n-[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n+- Reading the committed diff of each pass-one fix against its owning test, rather than the old report text, showed all three `render.ts` fixes intact in one pass (iteration 1). The deleted 35-entry `DOCTOR_COMMAND_STRINGS` map could have silently dropped a doctor bridge; a key-set comparison against `COMMAND_ROWS` proved it did not.\n+- Comparing duplicate command strings in `COMMAND_ROWS` before trusting the new class lookup avoided a false finding (iteration 1): the only two duplicates carry the same class.\n \n ---\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n \n-[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n+- Nothing failed yet. The remaining pass-one fixes (session readers, `subprocess.ts`, docs) are scheduled for iterations 2-4.\n \n ---\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n","status":"modified","additions":3,"deletions":2}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-2/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n- Reading the committed diff of each pass-one fix against its owning test, rather than the old report text, showed all three `render.ts` fixes intact in one pass (iteration 1). The deleted 35-entry `DOCTOR_COMMAND_STRINGS` map could have silently dropped a doctor bridge; a key-set comparison against `COMMAND_ROWS` proved it did not.\\n- Comparing duplicate command strings in `COMMAND_ROWS` before trusting the new class lookup avoided a false finding (iteration 1): the only two duplicates carry the same class.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n- Nothing failed yet. The remaining pass-one fixes (session readers, `subprocess.ts`, docs) are scheduled for iterations 2-4.\", \"oldString\": \"## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\", \"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-2/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794570638296,"end":1794570641110}}}}
