. |\n-| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | partial | Claude, Pi and DSH share `handleClaudeUserPromptSubmit` with a runtime label; OpenCode uses its own plugin path and is the subject of finding 3. Devenin and Codex have no prompt hook in this area. |\n+| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | partial | Claude, Pi and DSH share `handleClaudeUserPromptSubmit` with a runtime label; OpenCode uses its own plugin path and is the subject of finding 3. Devin and Codex have no prompt hook in this area. |\n | `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | deferred | `hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md` is iteration 4. |\n | `playbook_capability` | overlay | partial | `hooks/skill-advisor-hook-validation.md` Step 3 reviewed; finding 3 records where the playbook and code disagree. |\n \n ## Integration Evidence\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-2/iterations/iteration-002.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"OpenCode uses its own plugin path and is the subject of finding 3. Devin and Codex have no prompt hook in this area.\", \"oldString\": \"OpenCode uses its own plugin path and is the subject of finding 3. Devenin and Codex have no prompt hook in this area.\", \"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-2/iterations/iteration-002.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794570916081,"end":1794570916542}}}}
