-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-2/iterations/iteration-005.md\n@@ -68,9 +68,9 @@\n - Metrics surface: `runtime/lib/metrics.ts` `persistAdvisorHookDiagnosticRecord` (`:453-462`), `buildAdvisorHookHealthSection` (`:479-493`).\n \n ## Edge Cases\n \n-- **Generated declaration artifacts.** Twelve `yes` rows are `.d.mts`/`.d.mts.map` pairs. They are emitted TypeScript declaration maps; this pass did not read them line by line because a handwritten defect cannot live in them and the source declarations they mirror were reviewed with the readers. Recorded so the merged report does not imply they were inspected.\n+- **Generated declaration artifacts.** Four `yes` rows are `.d.mts.map` files. They are emitted TypeScript declaration maps; this pass did not read them line by line because a handwritten defect cannot live in them and the source declarations they mirror were reviewed with the readers. Recorded so the merged report does not imply they were inspected.\n - **Two caps, two units.** `subprocess.ts` caps characters at 1 MiB and the hook fallback caps stdout at 1 MiB bytes (`skill-advisor-cli-fallback.ts:92`). They protect different processes and the units differ on purpose (a byte cap for a pipe, a character cap for a string accumulator). Not a duplicated-constant finding.\n - **The plugin test-local `compiledRouteSummary()` factory is still used.** It builds summaries for the digest helper cases before and after the transform change (`tests/system-skill-advisor.test.cjs:317`, `:443-445`), so it is not dead.\n \n ## Confirmed-Clean Surfaces\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-2/iterations/iteration-005.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"- **Generated declaration artifacts.** Four `yes` rows are `.d.mts.map` files. They are emitted TypeScript declaration maps; this pass did not read them line by line because a handwritten defect cannot live in them and the source declarations they mirror were reviewed with the readers. Recorded so the merged report does not imply they were inspected.\", \"oldString\": \"- **Generated declaration artifacts.** Twelve `yes` rows are `.d.mts`/`.d.mts.map` pairs. They are emitted TypeScript declaration maps; this pass did not read them line by line because a handwritten defect cannot live in them and the source declarations they mirror were reviewed with the readers. Recorded so the merged report does not imply they were inspected.\", \"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-2/iterations/iteration-005.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794571557123,"end":1794571558691}}}}
